<PLACES><D>usa</D></PLACES>
<TEXT>&#2;
<TITLE>STANDARD OIL CORP TO FORM FINANCIAL UNIT</TITLE>
<DATELINE>    CLEVELAND, Feb 26 - </DATELINE><BODY>Standard Oil Co and BP North America Inc said they plan to form a venture to manage the money market borrowing and investment activities of both companies.
    BP North America is a subsidiary of British Petroleum Co Plc.
    The venture will be called St Paul Advisory Capital Inc.
    Standard Oil said the partnership will enable both companies to achieve financial economies of scale and better manage cash portfolios.
 Reuter
&#3;</BODY></TEXT>
</REUTERS>
