<TEXT>&#2;
<TITLE>TEXAS COMMERCE BANCSHARES FILES ANNUAL REPORT</TITLE>
<DATELINE>    HOUSTON, Feb 26 - </DATELINE><BODY>Texas Commerce Bancshares Inc said it filed its annual report with the SEC showing a net loss of 38.3 mln dlrs for 1986.
    The banking company said its bad debt provision was 428 mln dlrs, compared with 179 mln dlrs in 1985.
    Total loans stood at 11.8 billion dlrs at year end, down from 13.5 billion dlrs the previous year.
    Texas Commerce is merging with Chemical New York Corp.
 Reuter
&#3;</BODY></TEXT>
</REUTERS>
<REUTERS TOPICS="YES" LEWISSPLIT="TRAIN" CGISPLIT="TRAINING-SET" OLDID="5547" NEWID="4">
